  "text": "ABA · Module 4 Supplemental Readings Six readings on teaching procedures: discrete trial training, errorless learning, generalization, naturalistic teaching, prompting, and response prompting. Reading note:  Sources are three TARGET Texas Guide entries (discrete trial training, errorless learning and prompting, 2009); Burt and Whitney on generalization and Collins, Lo, Park and Haughney on response prompting, both  TEACHING Exceptional Children , 2018; and Allen and Shaw's chapter on naturalistic teaching (Luiselli, ed., Oxford, 2011). Reference lists sit in collapsible sections and are not read aloud. Where the original guides list dozens of study abstracts, the citations are given here and the full abstracts remain in the source PDF.",
